<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F2.sf4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(d)</span> </span><span id="S4.F2.sf4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Additional cost.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.F2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Proposed CBF-PA under various values of <math id="S4.F2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math>, shown over the contour plot of the function <math id="S4.F2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G(x,y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
